---

---

<section id="vision" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f7f6f2] via-[#f0f0ec] to-[#e8e8e4] px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-0 -translate-y-1/2 select-none opacity-[0.04]">
    <span class="font-serif text-[300px] leading-none text-gold md:text-[500px] lg:text-[700px]">"</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-divider mb-16 w-full"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div data-reveal="section">
      <p class="mb-8 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold uppercase">
        Visión
      </p>

      <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-8">
        <p
          data-reveal="word"
          class="font-serif text-3xl font-normal leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-warm sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
        >
          Creemos que la tecnología debe ser una ventaja competitiva,
          <span class="italic text-gold">no una barrera.</span>
        </p>

        <div class="h-px w-24 bg-gold/20"></div>

        <p
          data-reveal="fade"
          class="text-lg font-light leading-[1.7] text-muted sm:text-xl md:text-2xl"
        >
          Por eso construimos sistemas simples, escalables y duraderos.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
